device tree for orangepi one h3
I2S protocol

driving a max98357a amp


to build the .dtbo
dtc -I dts -O dtb -o sun8i-h3-i2s.dtbo sun8i-h3-i2s.dts

copy the .dtbo file
cp sun8i-h3-i2s.dtbo /boot/dtb/overlay/

copy the two sys file 
cp asound.conf /etc/
cp alsa-keepalive.service /etc/systemd/system/

now enable the alsa-keeplive.service
sudo systemctl start alsa-keepalive    
